   "id": "Default",
   "content": "<p>1. I am a United States citizen or a lawfully admitted permanent resident.  I am not a federal contractor as described <a href=\"https://www.fec.gov/help-candidates-and-committees/federal-government-contractors/#:~:text=A%20federal%20government%20contractor%20is,with%20funds%20appropriated%20by%20Congress.\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\n\n<p>2. I am at least 18 years of age.</p>\n\n<p>3. This contribution is made from my own funds, and these funds are not being provided to me by another person or entity for the purpose of making this contribution.</p>\n\n<p>4. I am making this contribution with my own personal credit card or drawn off my own personal bank account and not with a corporate or business credit card or bank account or a card or bank account issued to another person. Contributions from corporations, labor unions, federal government contractors, and foreign nationals without green cards are not permitted.</p>\n\n<p>5. Credit card and e-check donations are processed by Democracy Engine LLC. I have read and accept the Democracy Engine <a target=\"_demengtos\" href=\"https://www.democracyengine.com/subscriber_tos\"><u>Terms of Service</u></a>, <a target=\"_demengpriv\" href=\"https://www.democracyengine.com/subscriber_privacy_policy\"><u>Privacy Policy</u></a>, and <a target=\"_demengrefund\" href=\"https://democracyengine.com/refund-policy/\"><u>Refund Policy</u></a>.</p>\n\n\n<p>Please note the following:</p>\n\n<p>6. Federal law requires that we use our best efforts to obtain and report the name, mailing address, occupation and employer of individuals whose contributions exceed $200 in a calendar year. We respectfully require that partners of partnerships and members of LLC's contribute individually, instead of using the bank account or credit card of their business entity.</p>\n\n<p>7. Unless otherwise disclaimed, all donations to candidates or committees are earmarked donations within the meaning of 11 C.F.R. §110.6(b) to the Emgage Federal Political Action Committee (C00453704) for the designated recipient.</p>\n\n<p>8. Contributions to candidates and political committees are not tax deductible for federal income tax purposes.</p>"
